Package: blmturnout
Title: BLM Protests and Voter Turnout: A Causal Inference Approach
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kasey", "Zapatka", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your@email.com")
Description:
    Estimates the causal effect of Black Lives Matter protests on voter
    turnout in the 2020 general election using instrumental variables
    (rainfall as instrument for protest exposure) and spatial regression
    to correct for spatial autocorrelation. Georgia proof of concept.
